; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: the postings that an automated
; transaction adds balance by the same rule as the postings written in
; the transaction, real ones among themselves and [bracketed] ones among
; themselves.  Here the added real posting and the added bracketed one
; cancel each other out, which hid that the real postings of the
; transaction no longer balance.

= /^Expenses:Food/
    Liabilities:Budget                    -1
    [Budget:Food]                          1

2020-01-01 Grocery
    Expenses:Food                     $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 14:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 12-14:
> 2020-01-01 Grocery
>     Expenses:Food                     $10.00
>     Assets:Cash
Unbalanced remainder of real postings is:
             $-10.00
Amount to balance against:
              $10.00
While applying automated transaction from "$FILE", lines 8-10:
> = /^Expenses:Food/
>     Liabilities:Budget                    -1
>     [Budget:Food]                          1
While extending transaction from "$FILE", lines 12-14:
> 2020-01-01 Grocery
>     Expenses:Food                     $10.00
>     Assets:Cash
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
